<title>POLAND: Polish dwellings output up 21.2 pct yr/yr in March.</title>
<headline>Polish dwellings output up 21.2 pct yr/yr in March.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in March fell 16.9 percent from February but was 21.2 percent higher than in March 1996, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 4,164 flats were completed in March bringing the total for the January-March period to 12,939 flats.</p>
<p> POLISH DWELLINGS OUTPUT	 MARCH     FEB	MARCH 1996</p>
<p> year/year change (pct)	  21.2     32.5	   na</p>
<p> number of flats built	   4,164    5,011	 3,436</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
